# Website-demo runtime candidate runbook

REVIEW-ONLY

activation: blocked

The `website-demo` Compose profile is isolated from the SmartPBX profile and
binds only `127.0.0.1:{{website_port}}`. Its token endpoint follows the website
Voice SDK issuer response shape, but the generated conversation/media adapter
is intentionally unavailable. Do not point a TwiML App, public proxy, or the
website at this candidate until a client-neutral ConversationRelay or Media
Streams adapter has source-approved lifecycle evidence.

Website-demo Twilio credentials are supplied only to `{{website_service}}`.
Never copy them to `{{smartpbx_service}}`, and never add SmartPBX WSS/account
credentials to the website-demo service.
